<%- include('head') %><h1>Casting application settings</h1><p>Applications remain disabled until the client-approved casting terms are entered and confirmed. Existing applications remain available for review when new submissions are disabled.</p><form method="post" class="panel editor"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Terms version<input name="terms_version" maxlength="100" value="<%= config.terms_version %>"></label><label>Approved casting application terms<textarea name="terms" rows="16" maxlength="20000"><%= config.terms %></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="approved"> I confirm these terms are approved by the client for casting applications.</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%= config.enabled?'checked':'' %>> Enable public casting applications</label><button>Save application settings</button></form><%- include('foot') %>
